1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,632
When the whole world ran in fear of the poison…

2
00:00:02,712 --> 00:00:06,474
only one stepped forward and drank it. Do you know who?

3
00:00:06,787 --> 00:00:10,900
To get amrit, the nectar of immortality, the devas and asuras were churning the ocean together.

4
00:00:11,187 --> 00:00:12,971
Then, out of the ocean came Halahal.

5
00:00:13,051 --> 00:00:16,323
A poison so deadly, one drop could burn all of creation.

6
00:00:16,820 --> 00:00:19,104
The devas were terrified. The asuras stepped back.

7
00:00:19,184 --> 00:00:21,596
Everyone began calling just one name: Mahadev!

8
00:00:21,887 --> 00:00:24,434
Shiv ji asked no questions and set no conditions.

9
00:00:24,514 --> 00:00:26,537
He took all the poison, and drank it.

10
00:00:27,953 --> 00:00:31,945
Mata Parvati at once held his throat, so the poison would not go down.

11
00:00:32,453 --> 00:00:35,035
The poison stopped in his throat, and his throat turned blue.

12
00:00:35,115 --> 00:00:38,069
From that day he was called Neelkanth, the blue-throated one. Har Har Mahadev!

13
00:00:38,953 --> 00:00:41,038
Think about it… everyone wanted the amrit,

14
00:00:41,118 --> 00:00:43,020
but no one came forward to drink the poison.

15
00:00:43,700 --> 00:00:44,113
The lesson.

16
00:00:44,393 --> 00:00:47,395
True strength is taking others' pain upon yourself.

17
00:00:47,675 --> 00:00:50,378
The one who drinks poison for everyone is truly great.

18
00:00:50,987 --> 00:00:55,626
If you want to watch stories like this every day and learn something new,

19
00:00:55,706 --> 00:00:59,569
then Like the video, Share it, and Subscribe to the channel.

20
00:00:59,649 --> 00:01:01,267
See you in the next story!
